This repository distributes our SMFR benchmark, standalone baseline prompts
and runners, and engineered Simple-MAS and Expert-MAS reference pipelines for
"The Illusion of Automatically Orchestrated Multi-Agent Advantage".

The code and SMFR dataset are licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0; see LICENSE.txt
and dataset/LICENSE. The release includes synthetic tasks built from recorded
Yahoo Finance price observations.

Automated MAS framework implementations and third-party benchmark datasets
are not redistributed here. Names of external methods identify experimental
comparators and do not imply their code is included or relicensed.
